{"sections":[{"slug":"单纯形范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"单纯形范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯形范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"单纯形范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单纯形范畴的对象是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">标准</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>, “<span lang=\"zh\">组合</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的单纯形</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">单纯形范畴</span></strong> (simplex category) $\\Delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">是有限</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">非空</span></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全序集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全序集</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>\n$$\r\n\\Delta = \\{[0],[1],[2],\\cdots\\},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $[n] = \\{0&lt;1&lt;\\cdots &lt; n \\}$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯形范畴</span></strong> (augmented simplex category) $\\Delta_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">是有限</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全序集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全序集</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>\n$$\r\n\\Delta_+ = \\{[-1],[0],[1],[2],\\cdots\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>$\\Delta_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">单位为</span> $[-1]$, $[n] \\otimes [m] = [n+m+1]$. <span lang=\"zh\">注意</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个幺半范畴</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">不是</span></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">几何单纯形</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">标准</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维几何单纯形是</span> $\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的基向量</span> $e_0,e_1,\\cdots,e_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的凸包</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这定义了一个函子</span> $\\Delta \\to \\mathsf {Top}$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">游走的结合代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯形范畴</span> $\\Delta_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $[0]$ <span lang=\"zh\">生成的自由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $[0]$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/游走","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的结合代数</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">也即对任意幺半范畴</span> $\\mathcal M$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在唯一的幺半函子</span> $\\Delta_+ \\to M$, <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $[0]$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应到</span> $A$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}